<title>SINGAPORE: National Kap 1996 net losses widen.</title>
<headline>National Kap 1996 net losses widen.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss				 3.94  vs  2.66</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     0.00  vs  0.00</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	  (loss) 20.68  vs 13.93 (loss)</p>
<p>    Turnover				10.96  vs 16.30</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	0.12  vs  0.06</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		   0.68  vs  0.45</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)	     1.49  vs  1.63</p>
<p>    Profits from associates	    0.16  vs  0.06</p>
<p>    Pre-tax loss			   4.61  vs  2.86</p>
<p>    Tax			    (loss)  0.07  vs  0.60 (gain)</p>
<p>Note - Electronic components company National Kap Ltd said market conditions and prices remain weak and could expect only gradual improvement during 1997. -- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
